        "title": "SSS_Raythean Industries Test Platform - Logos+Haruka - Portable First-aid Kit",
        "details": "Emergency one-life-clear video is uploaded, please give it a like, coin, and favorite (三连).\nThis operation can complete two tasks of the [Competition Records Analyzer]. Replace the filler operators with four of the following: Blemishine, Fartooth, Platinum, Meteor, and Justice Knight. Start on Normal difficulty.\n═══════════════════════════════════\nOperation code：maa://77792\nCurrently, only manual team formation is supported. For all filler operators, please try to choose those with low cost. Recommended promotion level is Elite 2, minimum Elite 1 max level.\nFor all filler operators, do NOT choose skills that can only be used once per deployment (like Mountain's S2) or skills that require enemy contact to activate (like Degenbrecher's S3), otherwise MAA will keep spamming the skill. Also avoid skills with overly strange attack ranges (like Schwarz's S3).\nAfter confirming that the Amplifier selection is set to [Portable First-aid Kit], all Tactical Equipment set to A, manual team formation is complete, and the lineup is verified, click Start.\nOperation author: 萨拉托加\nvideo：【MAA保全派驻-雷神工业测试平台-逻各斯-遥-便携式医疗设备】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11hqgBaETE/\nJSON author：萨拉托加\n═══════════════════════════════════\nAdditional operators not including core selections:\nDefender x6 (Prioritize self-healing healing defenders, e.g., Saria, Shu, Nearl, Gummy, and other defenders with DP cost around 20, e.g., Hoshiguma, Yu)\nSniper x4 (Try to choose low-cost fast snipers)\nCaster x3 (Try to choose casters with DP cost around 20. If choosing AoE casters, bring DP-reduction modules. Recommend operators with AoE skills, e.g., Eyjafjalla S3, Goldenglow S3, LapplandAlt S3; bring Dusk for the \"Four Seasons\" bonus if applicable)\nMedic x5 (Must choose proper healers. Prioritize AoE healers with X-type modules to ensure they can heal the three tiles in front)\n═══════════════════════════════════\nFor issues, please report in the group: 216314927. Feedback in the comment section may not be replied to in a timely manner.\nSome core selections can be modified in the operation files according to personal needs, but do not upload them to the operation website. Using this operation implies agreement to these terms.",
